WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.180
Make everyone smile with your duel, eh?

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:07.780
Yuya, I think I finally understand

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.420
what you were talking about, a bit.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.250
Was I dueling?

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.540
D-Wheels.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.770
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:35.520
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.960
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.100
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.990
Dedication That Does Not Falter

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:23.720
Is he...

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.600
Yeah, I knew it.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.130
He's the one who kidnapped Rin...

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.530
Hey, you! Wait up!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:40.410
W-Wait a minute. Hugo ran off, too?

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:46.080
I ordered you to let Serena win at any cost!

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:47.800
Why?!

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:53.880
But now that she's lost, in front 
of that huge crowd,

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:57.270
there is no way I can make Serena a star.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.110
Attention, all security around the Duel Palace!

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.550
That Hugo boy, was it?

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:14.200
Starving Venom,

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.610
did you bring us together?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:19.310
Hold up, damn you!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.310
What a pain...

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.660
That isn't fair!

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.650
Damn it!

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:34.550
I... I was just dueling Serena.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.220
A dream?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.650
But it was the same as during 
Hugo's duel with Sawatari.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.590
Odd-Eyes lit up, and I felt like I was dueling...

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:49.530
Does that mean Hugo's consciousness 
is linked to mine?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:54.750
Hugo won... Does that mean Serena 
will be sent underground?

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:59.550
We must work together to protect Serena.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.720
I shall take them into custody, 
and look after them myself.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:06.380
Roget won't only send Serena underground.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.560
Serena's in trouble!

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:15.610
Is that the legendary entrance to hell?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:26.850
What are you...

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.560
Nerve gas?

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:31.820
That's cheating.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.300
Target in custody.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.790
Good. Bring her here immediately.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.350
S-Stop it...

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.990
L-Let me go.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.460
You call yourselves duelists?

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.210
Who are you?

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.710
You're in our way. Clear out.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.180
My turn.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.260
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.060
I summon Film Magician from my hand!

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:23.590
0 attack points?

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.130
What's the point of sending 
out a monster like that?

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.510
Don't tell me you're going to fight us.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.610
D-Don't do it... You can't!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.050
Run away, Layra!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.690
Film Magician cannot be destroyed by battle.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.120
What's that?

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.340
And Film Magician's attack points

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.510
become equal to those of 
the monster that attacks it.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:53.850
In other words, you force a tie, 
so only the attacker is destroyed?

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:57.240
I now end my turn.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.840
Layra!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.710
Interesting.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.700
I don't know whose little brat you are,

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:09.260
but I suspect you're a Commons, riled up 
by Shinji's and Crow's duels.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.920
But your little dream ends here.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.410
Layra...

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:21.490
Jack crawled his way up from poverty, 
to stand atop all duelists.

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:27.180
One single card gave him the will to 
become stronger than anyone,

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.730
as a person and a duelist.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.350
I've decided, too.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.480
I can't run away.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:36.260
I'm going to fight properly.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:41.880
For myself... And for my team.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.650
I won't let you have Serena!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:47.450
And I won't let any of you leave this place!

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:50.380
Stop acting above your station.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:51.420
My turn!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.390
I summon Jutte Lord from my hand!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:04.840
Its effect lets me Special Summon a Tuner 
Monster, Jutte Fighter, from my hand.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:11.540
Level 2 Jutte Fighter tunes Level 4 Jutte Lord!

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:17.660
Shooter of iron hammers that 
strikes down the lawless.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.020
Synchro Summon.

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:23.220
Behold the power of authority!

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:26.860
Appear, Level 6 Goyo Catapult!

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:33.200
Goyo Catapult lets me discard 
one monster per turn,

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.380
to deal 600 points of damage to you!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:45.760
Sorry, but even if you summon 
an invincible monster,

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.380
we have many other ways of hurting you.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.260
Layra...

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.810
I now end my turn.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:55.320
But you aren't off the hook yet.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:59.940
We'll beat the pointlessness 
of fighting authority into you!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.370
My turn!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.100
I activate my Goyo Catapult's effect.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.270
I send one monster from my 
hand to my graveyard,

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.220
to deal 600 points of damage to you!

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:16.700
I now end my turn.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.130
But the punishment isn't over yet.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:20.410
My turn!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.440
Stop it...

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:25.020
No more, please...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.490
I send one monster from my 
hand to my graveyard,

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:32.790
to deal you 600 points of damage 
from Goyo Catapult's effect!

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.160
Layra!

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:42.170
I now end my turn.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.970
Well, what now? Done already?

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:49.010
Weren't you going to stop any of us from leaving?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:53.610
You Commons are all the same. 
Nothing but talk.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:54.620
I...

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.190
Layra...

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.810
My turn. Draw!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:13.050
I activate Continuous Spell Nightmare 
Critical Loop from my hand!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:19.380
This card lets me tribute one monster 
on my side of the field, each turn.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.440
He destroyed his own monster?

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.040
What's the point of that?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.830
He's just making trouble... 
That's all Commons can do.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:34.990
Brother...

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.900
He's incredible! He's going to fight us all?

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.880
Layra, go on to Serena.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.450
Roget won't simply send Serena underground.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.500
Go stop him.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.470
Tsukikage must have told you the 
entrance to the underground.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:58.290
Now, go!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:09:59.710
R-Right.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.180
Damn you! Wait—

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:06.340
My turn isn't over yet.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.520
If you want to see your mission through,

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:13.490
you will need to formulate a 
plan to counter my strategy.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.550
I'll protect Serena!

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:21.930
I summon C/C Critical Eye from my hand!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.460
I'll say it once more. I won't let you have Serena.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:35.510
And I won't let any one of you leave here!

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:37.700
Layra...

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:48.500
I activate my Continuous Spell 
Montage Fusion from my hand!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:53.330
This card's effect lets me film Goyo 
Catapult on your side of the field.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:00.570
I fuse the Goyo Catapult I filmed with Critical Eye!

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:04.780
What? He copied my monster and 
used it as a fusion component?

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:10.090
Shooter of iron hammers, reside in 
my eye and offer me your power!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.460
Fusion Summon!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.500
Appear, sword of steel that 
slices through everything.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.960
Level 6 C/C/C Rock Sword of Battle!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.560
When Rock Sword attacks,

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:30.330
its attack points increase by the total 
number of Earth Attribute Monsters

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.570
on the field, besides itself.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.670
Total monsters, besides itself?

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.040
Which means, our Goyo Catapults...

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:41.510
Yes. Three instances of 800.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:46.470
In other words, Rock Sword's attack 
points increase by 2400.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:50.190
4800?

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:51.390
Battle.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:55.790
Go, Rock Sword! Attack the first Goyo Catapult!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:09.440
But that's his only possible attack.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.850
Now, go on and end your turn!

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.850
On my next turn, I'll—

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.390
It isn't over yet!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.580
What?

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:20.720
You said you didn't understand 
why I tributed a monster

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.260
when I activated Nightmare 
Critical Loop, remember?

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.330
It was to use this effect.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:32.480
On the same turn I tribute a monster, 
Nightmare Critical Loop

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:37.440
allows me to tribute one monster Critical 
Eye was used to summon,

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.390
and return Critical Eye from my graveyard.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:49.880
Then I activate Quick-Play Spell 
Critical Tuning from my hand.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:54.590
Its effect lets me negate Critical 
Eye's effect for one turn,

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:56.420
to treat it as a Tuner Monster.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.250
A Tuner?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.310
Don't tell me...

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:05.530
And Critical Tuning lets me reduce 
Goyo Catapult's level from 6 to 3,

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:07.990
and film it with this card!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:12.970
M-My monster, too.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.720
Level 3 Critical Eye tunes the Critical Tuning

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:21.450
that filmed Level 3 Goyo Catapult!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.510
Burned image of shooter of iron hammers,

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:27.930
synchronize with my eye, 
and offer me your power!

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:30.420
Synchro Summon!

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:35.260
Come out, exquisite gun that 
shoots through everything.

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:39.500
Level 6 C/C/C Rock Blaster of Battle!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.530
A Synchro Summon in the middle 
of the Battle Phase?

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.840
I activate Rock Shooter's effect.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:51.180
Once per turn, I can reduce the attack points 
of one of your monsters by 1000.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.610
0 attack points?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.930
Battle! Go, Rock Blaster!

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:02.220
Attack the second Goyo Catapult!

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:06.140
In that instant, Rock Shooter's 
attack points increase

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:10.930
by 200 times the sum of the levels of all 
Earth Attribute Monsters, besides itself.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:15.430
The levels of our Goyo Catapults are 6 and 3.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:17.540
9 times 200 is...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.280
1800 points?!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.330
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:32.980
You're the last one!

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:38.960
Nightmare Critical Loop's effect

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:42.430
allows me to tribute C/C/C Rock Blaster of Battle,

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:46.400
to call Critical Eye back from the graveyard.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:55.560
And I activate Critical Overlay from my hand!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:15:01.020
Its effect lets Critical Overlay 
film your Goyo Catapult.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:05.440
At the same time, it negates 
its effect, to take the same

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:11.450
type, attribute, level, and attack and defense 
points as the Goyo Catapult it filmed!

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:17.300
This is... This time, will he...

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:21.680
I overlay the Critical Overlay 
that filmed Goyo Catapult

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:25.030
and the now Level 6 Critical Eye!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.710
Ruler of the majestic land,

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:35.630
reside in my eye and offer me your power!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.850
Xyz Summon!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:42.910
Appear, the ultimate armor 
that deflects everything.

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:47.320
Rank 6 C/C/C Rock Armor of Battle!

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:53.130
I use one Overlay Unit to activate 
Rock Armor's effect!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.680
This monster's attack points increase

00:15:55.680 --> 00:16:01.370
by half of the total defense points of all 
Earth Attribute Monsters on the field.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:05.080
Goyo Catapult has 2800 defense points...

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:08.060
And Rock Armor's defense points are 2000.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:14.120
Half of 4800 is 2400, added to 
2500 attack points.

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:18.320
Go! Time for battle, Rock Armor!

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.560
Attack the third Goyo Catapult!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.340
Three enemies

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:44.280
taken out with Fusion, Synchro, and Xyz.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:55.590
Not long ago, Layra was so frightened...

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:00.610
Tsukikage?

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.760
Master Layra has changed.

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:05.540
Now, he does not always need protection.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.010
What happened? Hey! Where's Serena?

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:13.210
Lady Serena is safely in our custody.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.980
What? Who are you?

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.870
My name is Tsukikage.

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:20.890
Administrative Council building! 
What are you doing?

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:22.040
Can't you hear me?!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.090
It cannot be.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.940
The security squad at the council 
building has been defeated.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.330
The five council members are safe, as well.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:36.110
If he could beat them this easily,

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.770
he could have done it sooner...

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:41.560
It seems he was timing it,

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:45.240
so he could send that Layra 
boy to save Serena.

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.600
If he wanted to preserve City's peace,

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:51.560
he should have prioritized our 
safety before Serena's.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:55.120
Well, for now, it all worked out.

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.720
Right, chairman?

00:17:56.990 --> 00:18:00.880
Yes. And in the tug-of-war between 
Roget and Reiji Akaba,

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:04.460
the latter seems to be one step in the lead.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.150
Judging by your expression,

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.540
I assume you failed to take 
Serena into custody.

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.680
I won't let you have Yuzu Hiiragi or Serena.

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:15.270
Naturally, not Academia, either.

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:19.960
Damn you! You say you have 
Yuzu Hiiragi, as well?

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:23.420
I already have all of City in my hands...

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:27.620
I'll teach you that there is 
nothing more you can do!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.200
How is Sergey's surgery coming?!

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.800
It's finished.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:35.230
The control device's precision should also increase.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:38.810
Good. Then send him to the Administrative 
Council building at once.

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.160
Hurry the preparations!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.000
Yes, sir!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.640
Reiji Akaba...

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:49.790
No matter where he's hidden Serena and 
Yuzu Hiiragi, I shall recover them.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:54.480
And then, Sergey will kill both 
him and the Council...

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.450
To achieve that,

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:02.250
it is necessary to make the people 
focus on the Friendship Cup.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:07.950
Everyone in the Duel Palace, 
as well as all over City!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.680
I have a big surprise to announce!

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:14.870
We just received word from 
the tournament organizers,

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:20.340
that they've decided to hold the 
first match of the semifinals

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.420
right here, this evening!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:26.920
My, a night game here, in City?

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:29.550
This sounds delightful.

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:31.440
We can't go back yet!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.250
I can watch another match 
without paying extra?

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.790
I'm so lucky!

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:42.500
The Public Order Bureau...

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.770
If Yuya's being held, it must be here.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.810
Odd-Eyes...

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.740
The first night I met Hugo...

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:59.340
Ute's and my dragons seemed 
to be calling to each other.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:04.350
Then Hugo's dragon called 
to Ute's dragon, too.

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:07.650
When that happened, I felt tightness 
and heat in my heart...

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:11.290
And Ute disappeared inside me.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:16.920
The people who look like me... 
And our dragons...

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:22.070
If my consciousness is entering 
Hugo's when he duels...

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.470
Odd-Eyes,

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.820
do you guys have something to do with that?

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:31.740
Get out.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:42.250
I don't care if the battle is moved up, but why?

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.460
To start the semifinals right now...

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:48.060
I'm afraid I don't know, either.

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:52.020
It appears Layra was able to save Serena.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:56.150
And I've confirmed that Roget does 
not have Yuzu Hiiragi, either.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.260
Has Tsukikage made his move?

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:03.720
That means I have both of the 
pieces that he desires.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:06.360
Which means the next step is, of course...

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.140
All teams are in place.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.490
Remain on stand by until you 
receive new orders.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:20.220
The preparations have been made.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.220
Now, I just need to kill Reiji 
Akaba and the Council,

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.910
and take Serena and Yuzu Hiiragi into custody.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:30.180
Then not even Academia 
will be able to stop me.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:33.450
And I shall become...

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.580
this dimension's king!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:58.000
Damn... Where did that jerk go?

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:02.190
We know this will be a battle 
for the history books.

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:06.470
The first match of the semifinals, 
here at the Friendship Cup, is...

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:10.900
Yuya Sakaki versus Crow Hogan!

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:52.220
Right now, the Administrative 
Council and our team

00:23:52.220 --> 00:23:54.720
are in security's custody.

00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:57.980
Roget is trying to take control of City.

00:23:57.980 --> 00:23:58.960
What was that?

00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:03.090
If the Public Order Bureau takes control of 
City, what happens to us Commons?

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:04.120
That's why, Crow...

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:05.760
I have to ask you a favor.

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:07.830
I don't know what's going on, but leave it to me.

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:11.320
Yuya, I'm gonna make this a show!

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:15.570
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Memories of the Beast.

00:24:15.570 --> 00:24:17.540
The fun is only getting started!
